// # Install Subsystem — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: How the toolchain lands on a machine. Bash bootstrap for curl | bash portability.
//          Toolchain-only — LLM-harness scanning/wiring removed 2026-09-11 (020693a).
//
// Setup: Pure structural file. VERSION must match the current git tag (RULES.oot §1.24 exception).
//
// Beats:
//   1. install.sh is the thin bash bootstrap (OS/arch detect, curl, SHA-256 sidecar verify,
//      std clone, ~/.bashrc exports). Missing or mismatched sidecar refuses (fail-closed).
//   2. VERSION must match the current git tag (§1.24 exception — hand-bumped because
//      curl|bash has no git history at install time).
//   3. Idempotent; --dry-run previews; ~/.bashrc backed up as .bak.openooda before edit;
//      bash-only shell rc (zsh/fish dropped 2026-09-11, 34f4d54 — other shells export manually).
//   4. To propose a change, keep every file ≤256 lines and fail closed.
